This repository has no vendored third-party source dependencies. It uses Apple
platform frameworks and tools (Foundation, Security, SwiftUI,
UserNotifications, ServiceManagement, and `/usr/bin/osascript` talking to
Messages) supplied by the operating system and Swift Package Manager. The
paired-self sender does not bundle `imsg`, a Contacts/Messages database reader,
GitHub/`gh`, Codex/OpenAI, or any existing personal gateway. Cboe and Alpha
Vantage are external data services; their names and data are subject to their
own marks, terms, licenses, attribution requirements, and rate limits. This
project does not claim or grant rights to their data.
